%% AS-BUILT sequence: the approval path. Cite each message S1-S5
sequenceDiagram
  actor U as Approver
  participant MW as SessionAuthMiddleware
  participant C as ApprovalsController
  participant S as ApprovalService
  participant M as InMemoryInvoiceRepository
  U->>MW: POST /api/approvals/invoiceId/approve - S1
  MW->>C: session set; RequireRole Approver or Admin - S2
  C->>S: Approve invoiceId, username - S3
  S->>M: GetById then Update status=Approved - S4
  M-->>S: invoice
  S-->>C: invoice
  C-->>U: 200 OK / 404 / 409 via Handle - S5
